:: Deadwood Robin Shop Partnership
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'deadwood_robin_shop'>><<effects>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck or $combat>><<exit>><</if>>
<<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-shop-partnership'>>
  <<set _partnership to maplebirch.get('Robin').shop.partnership>>
  <<if !$RobinExpansion.shop or !_partnership.state.agreed>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The shop has not opened yet.' '店铺还没开张。'>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Your copy of the agreement is kept with the shop accounts. You and Robin own half each. Additional advances and the shop's working money have their own entries.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你的那份协议与营业账本放在一起。你与罗宾各持一半，后来垫入的钱和店里的周转金另有记录。
    <</language>><br><br>
    <<deadwood-partnership-accounts 'shop'>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('Robin').shop.atLedger>>
      <<npc Robin>><<person1>>
      <<lanSwitch 'Robin checks the figures against the receipts. "Best leave enough for the next delivery. We can take the rest out when we know what we need."' '罗宾拿着收据核对数字。“下一批货的钱得先留下。弄清楚要花多少，再拿出来也不迟。”'>><br><br>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Robin').canSpend(100)>>
      <<lanLink ['Ask Robin to advance £100', '请罗宾垫入£100']>>
        <<run maplebirch.get('Robin').shop.fundFromRobin(100)>>
        <<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-shop-partnership')>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
      <<if _partnership.state.loans.partner gt 0 and _partnership.state.treasury gt 0>>
        <<lanLink ["Repay Robin's available advances", '归还能够偿还的罗宾垫款']>>
          <<if maplebirch.get('Robin').shop.atLedger and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$combat>>
            <<run maplebirch.get('Robin').shop.partnership.repay(true)>>
            <<run maplebirch.get('Robin').shop.partnership.collect()>>
          <</if>>
          <<run Dynamic.render('deadwood-shop-partnership')>>
        <</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Close the accounts', '合上账本'] 'Deadwood Robin Shop'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Shop Investment
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'financial_centre'>><<effects>>
<<if Time.weekDay lt 2 or Time.weekDay gt 6 or Time.hour lt 9 or Time.hour gte 17>>
  <<deadwood-reblooms-finance-counter-closed>>
<<else>>
<<deadwood-reblooms-adrian-greeting 'financial_centre_securities'>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The clerk returns the shop agreement. "This is a private partnership. You and Robin own half each. The trading desk cannot sell either founder's share." A finger points to the old account statement. "Earlier positions can still be closed through their original accounts."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    柜员把店铺协议递回来。“这是私人合伙，你和罗宾各持一半。交易柜台不能出售你们的创始份额。”手指点在旧账户结单上。“以前的持仓，仍可在原账户处理退出。”
<</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to securities services', '返回证券业务台'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Financial Centre Securities'>><</lanLink>>
